### 东信和平用户灯光颜色映射测试
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8090

### 0. 前置：在数据库中配置用户颜色映射（手工执行）
### REPLACE INTO t_user_light_color(user_id, color, enabled, remark)
### VALUES ('USER-COLOR-01', 'YELLOW', 1, '用户颜色映射测试'),
###        ('USER-COLOR-02', 'BLUE', 1, '用户颜色映射测试');

### 1. 上传场景：USER-COLOR-01 触发亮灯时应优先使用 YELLOW
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/light/picking/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "waveNo": "WV-COLOR-0001",
  "userId": "USER-COLOR-01",
  "userName": "颜色用户1",
  "updateTime": 1648195200000,
  "details": [
    {
      "id": "COLOR-U-001",
      "materialCode": "MAT-COLOR-01",
      "batchNo": "B-COLOR-01",
      "locationCode": "A-09-01",
      "planQuantity": 10,
      "actualQuantity": 0,
      "status": 0
    }
  ]
}

### 2. 完成场景：USER-COLOR-02 触发亮灯时应优先使用 BLUE
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/light/picking/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "waveNo": "WV-COLOR-0002",
  "userId": "USER-COLOR-02",
  "userName": "颜色用户2",
  "updateTime": 1648195200000,
  "details": [
    {
      "id": "COLOR-C-001",
      "materialCode": "MAT-COLOR-02",
      "batchNo": "B-COLOR-02",
      "locationCode": "A-09-02",
      "planQuantity": 6,
      "actualQuantity": 0,
      "status": 0
    }
  ]
}

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/light/picking/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "waveNo": "WV-COLOR-0002",
  "userId": "USER-COLOR-02",
  "details": [
    {
      "materialCode": "MAT-COLOR-02",
      "batchNo": "B-COLOR-02",
      "locationCode": "A-09-02",
      "planQuantity": 6,
      "actualQuantity": 3,
      "updateTime": 1648195201000
    }
  ]
}

### 3. 未配置映射用户：按旧逻辑兜底（上传：单人GREEN/多人BLUE；完成：单人GREEN/多人CYAN）
